      "title": "Macie Policy:IAMUser/S3BucketPublic on exports-prod-7f3a",
      "severity": "SEV2",
      "firedAt": "09:14"
    },
    "evidence": [
      {
        "type": "log",
        "label": "CloudTrail (s3.amazonaws.com), exports-prod-7f3a",
        "lines": [
          {
            "ts": "08:58:20",
            "level": "INFO",
            "source": "cloudtrail",
            "text": "GetBucketPolicyStatus user=AssumedRole/platform-admin/jlee"
          },
          {
            "ts": "09:02:41",
            "level": "INFO",
            "source": "cloudtrail",
            "text": "PutBucketPolicy user=AssumedRole/platform-admin/jlee Deny Principal:* s3:* if aws:SecureTransport=false; Allow Principal:* s3:GetObject if aws:SourceVpce=vpce-0a1b2c3d4e5f60718"
          },
          {
            "ts": "09:05:09",
            "level": "INFO",
            "source": "cloudtrail",
            "text": "PutBucketEncryption user=AssumedRole/platform-admin/jlee SSEAlgorithm=aws:kms"
          },
          {
            "ts": "09:11:33",
            "level": "INFO",
            "source": "cloudtrail",
            "text": "PutBucketPolicy user=AssumedRole/platform-admin/jlee Deny Principal:* s3:* if aws:SecureTransport=false; Allow Principal:* s3:GetObject if aws:Referer like https://portal.example.com/*"
          },
          {
            "ts": "09:12:02",
            "level": "INFO",
            "source": "cloudtrail",
            "text": "PutBucketTagging user=AssumedRole/platform-admin/jlee data-class=confidential"
          },
          {
            "ts": "09:13:48",
            "level": "INFO",
            "source": "cloudtrail",
            "text": "GetBucketPolicyStatus user=AssumedRole/platform-admin/jlee"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "facts",
        "label": "exports-prod-7f3a",
        "items": [
          {
            "key": "Block Public Access",
            "value": "off at bucket and account (static-site legacy)"
          },
          {
            "key": "Object Ownership",
            "value": "BucketOwnerEnforced (ACLs disabled)"
          },
          {
            "key": "Ticket",
            "value": "\"Let portal users download reports directly\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "question": "Tap the call that made the bucket readable by anyone.",
    "answer": {
      "evidence": 0,
      "line": 3
    },
    "explanation": {
      "cause": "A Principal:* GetObject grant conditioned only on aws:Referer — which S3 treats as public.",
      "why": "S3 calls a policy non-public only if it pins fixed values of keys like aws:SourceVpce, aws:SourceIp or a principal. aws:Referer isn't one: it is a client-supplied header anyone can set. The 09:02 policy was VPC-endpoint-only; the 09:11 rewrite swapped that for Referer. Fix: CloudFront with OAC plus signed URLs.",
      "tell": "Both policies say Principal:*, but only the second one swaps a fixed aws:SourceVpce for a spoofable aws:Referer, and Macie fires minutes later."
    },
    "source": {
      "title": "AWS: Blocking public access to your Amazon S3 storage — The meaning of \"public\"",
      "url": "https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonS3/latest/userguide/access-control-block-public-access.html#access-control-block-public-access-policy-status"
    }
  },
